---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbList = [{"name": "Home", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/"}, {"name": "Medical Disclaimer", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/medical-disclaimer/"}];
---

<Layout
  title="Medical Disclaimer"
  description="Medical Disclaimer for True Joy Birthing. Our website, app, birth plan templates, birth plan confidence sessions, city guides, and blog content are for educational purposes only and do not constitute medical advice."
  canonical="https://truejoybirthing.com/medical-disclaimer/"
  breadcrumbList={breadcrumbList}
  schema={{
    "@graph": [{
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Medical Disclaimer",
      "description": "Medical Disclaimer for True Joy Birthing products and services.",
      "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/medical-disclaimer"
    }]
  }}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-tjb-cream pt-16 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Medical Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-tjb-gray">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-8">

      <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">True Joy Birthing provides birth education, birth plan templates, birth plan confidence sessions, city guides, blog content, and a free mobile app. This Medical Disclaimer explains the nature and limits of the information and services we provide. Please read it carefully.</p>

      <!-- Emergency Notice -->
      <div class="rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-red-500 bg-red-50">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3m0 3h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" />
          </svg>
          <p class="text-red-800 font-semibold leading-relaxed">If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room immediately. This website is not for emergencies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. No Medical Advice -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-rose-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">1. No Medical Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">The True Joy Birthing website, mobile app, birth plan templates, birth plan confidence sessions, blog posts, city guides, and all other content (collectively, the "Services") are provided for educational and informational purposes only. The Services do not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Nothing on this website or in our app should be interpreted as a substitute for professional medical evaluation, diagnosis, or care.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. No Provider-Patient Relationship -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">2. No Provider-Patient Relationship</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Using the Services does not create a provider-patient relationship, clinical relationship, or any other form of professional healthcare relationship between you and True Joy Birthing, Agentic Trust, or any of our contributors, employees, or affiliates. No such relationship is established by reading our content, using our birth plan builder, or attending a birth plan confidence session.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Always Consult a Professional -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">3. Always Consult a Professional</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Always consult with your qualified healthcare provider — including your OB-GYN, midwife, doula, or other licensed medical professional — before making any decisions about your pregnancy, labor, delivery, or postpartum care. Do not disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you read, heard, or saw in our Services. Your healthcare provider is the appropriate person to evaluate your individual circumstances and provide personalized guidance.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Emergency Disclaimer -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-rose-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">4. Emergency Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed font-semibold text-tjb-charcoal">If you experience a medical emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room immediately.</p>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-2">Do not rely on this website, our app, or any of our Services for emergency situations. The Services are not designed or intended to address urgent or emergency medical needs. If you believe you or your baby may be in danger, contact emergency services or your healthcare provider immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Birth Plans Are Not Medical Orders -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">5. Birth Plans Are Not Medical Orders</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">A birth plan created using our tools is a communication tool, not a medical order or clinical protocol. Your healthcare team — including your OB-GYN, midwife, nurses, and other providers — may need to deviate from your birth plan based on their clinical judgment and the specific circumstances of your labor and delivery. Medical decisions during labor and delivery are made by your licensed healthcare providers based on real-time clinical conditions. Always discuss your birth plan with your provider well before your due date so they can review it, provide feedback, and help you understand what to expect.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. No Guarantees -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">6. No Guarantees</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Every birth is unique. We cannot guarantee specific outcomes, results, or experiences based on using our tools, following any birth plan, or attending a birth plan confidence session. Birth outcomes depend on many factors beyond our control, including your individual health, your baby's health, your medical history, the decisions of your healthcare providers, and circumstances that arise during labor and delivery. No content or tool provided by True Joy Birthing should be understood as a promise, warranty, or guarantee of any particular result.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Limitation of Liability -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, neither Agentic Trust, True Joy Birthing, nor any of their officers, directors, employees, contributors, contractors, or affiliates shall be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of data, income, or goodwill, arising out of or related to your use of the Services, reliance on any information provided, or any decisions made based on the Services.</p>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">In no event shall our total aggregate liability for any claim arising out of or related to the Services exceed the amount you paid us for the Services in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim. If you have not paid us anything for the Services in the prior twelve months, our total aggregate liability shall be limited to one hundred dollars ($100).</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Ambassador and Doula Listings -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">8. Ambassador and Doula Listings</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Our website may feature ambassadors and doulas through our Ambassador Program. These listings are informational only and do not constitute referrals, endorsements, or medical recommendations. True Joy Birthing does not vet, endorse, or guarantee the qualifications of any listed ambassador or doula. You must independently evaluate any provider before engaging their services. True Joy Birthing is not responsible for the care or advice provided by listed ambassadors or doulas.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 9. Contact -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">If you have questions about this Medical Disclaimer, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@truejoybirthing.com" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors">support@truejoybirthing.com</a>.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-tjb-gray">
          <p>Agentic Trust</p>
          <p>104 E 600 S, #519</p>
          <p>Heber City, UT 84032</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Related links -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-tjb-lavender-200/50 text-center">
        <p class="text-tjb-gray mb-4">Related: <a href="/privacy/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Terms of Use</a></p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Back to Home →</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>